# Run artifacts -- regenerate by rerunning; never commit.
# outputs/* rather than outputs/: git will not re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so the README exception below needs the directory
# itself to stay walkable.
wandb/
outputs/*
!outputs/retired/
outputs/retired/*
!outputs/retired/README.md

# Outreach drafts: contain third-party email addresses, and this repo is public.
COLLABORATION_EMAILS.md

# Third-party reference glasses, held out pending a licence check.
#
# a-Li3PS4 and a-Li7P3S11 from the PCCP class2 force-field study, converted to
# CIF here. They are used as test fixtures only: the a-Li3PS4 model encodes its
# speciation in LAMMPS atom types, which makes it ground truth for the
# `speciation` classifier (647 PS4 / 242 P2S6 / 222 P2S7 P atoms), and both are
# read as literature comparison points for the disorder gate. They are never
# inputs to a result.
#
# Not committed because they came from a paper's supplementary data and the
# terms are unresolved. Re-derive them from the published deposit rather than
# passing the CIFs around. Tests that need them skip when they are absent --
# see tests/test_glass_quality.py::test_speciation_matches_an_independently_labelled_structure.
data/crystal-structures/ref_a*_pccp.cif
